Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 用这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴唇好像有点干
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.21,0:00:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊\N- 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,会变成接吻哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是想那样 那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的话我会很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊~ 出汗了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还不太习惯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,已经两个月过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以借我用一下吗 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,学校放学后 来我家玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 来到这里很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,想喝点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,下周星期三 大概到晚上家里都没人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了\N- 我吃完了 谢谢你招待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,新年快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这边住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那边是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有个大叔好像住那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大叔\N- 怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大概十年了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔能听到他的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这边住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果弄脏了对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说没关系就是没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我去确认一下房间是否空着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是什么人的鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,后跟好像被咬过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那个和椅子是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小优
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,上来吧 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 有味道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没有味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来到这里的家很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次约会买的情侣玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你和奈欧可以在一起了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 这个作业是上周的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 多看了些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快坐下快坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 已经看够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,已经满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是来玩的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 这是我的家嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么突然安静了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊 要不玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你做了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 就做到这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,作业还是要好好做的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再等会儿好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还好吗\N- 小优
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,老叔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,老叔是小优爸爸的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们老叔帮了小优爸爸很多忙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是吗 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:08:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是小优的男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 年轻人就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了 小优
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小优 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就到这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,今天又没做成呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,努力一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,和真央交往之前的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为那本书的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次嘛 大家都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大人们啊 都是这样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己交给叔叔 会感觉很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头伸出来给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别吸我的舌头哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让你分泌唾液
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,耳朵也来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的耳朵真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,会抖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是身体反应
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你躺下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这样摸着 你会起鸡皮疙瘩的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那么再来一次 舌头伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的 唾液都流出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的耳朵很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把叔叔的嘴也吸一下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的耳朵很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点痒 但感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊 虽然有点痒 但感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样慢慢长大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你也摸摸叔叔的耳朵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是这样的吗\N- 对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,让你舒服点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔也会有感觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,轻点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢摸摸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.37,0:17:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.55,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好孩子 由美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你的皮肤真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你反应这么大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,身体都在发抖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都会这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不要害羞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只要交给叔叔 就不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让我好好看看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这边放在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的皮肤真白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔对你很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,由美 耳朵很敏感 全身都敏感吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要看看胸部呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.99,0:22:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.89,0:22:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要看看你的胸部了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮的胸部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 这样用手捏一捏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很有弹性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,穿衣服的时候看不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,原来挺大的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.38,0:23:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.86,0:23:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看 还能看到这么深的乳沟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吸的话感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.46,0:24:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.15,0:24:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.55,0:24:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要舔一下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,又开始抖了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,声音都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.34,0:25:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的 声音出来也没事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子不需要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.06,0:25:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 躺下来再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不用害怕了 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.68,0:26:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好软好大
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,由美的胸部真的很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,湿湿的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:26:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,由美你也开始觉得舒服了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.29,0:26:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.34,0:27:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,声都出来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.41,0:27:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.07,0:27:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那这次来下面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,腰好细哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.60,0:27:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,把衣服脱下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.30,0:27:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结衣你还是有点害羞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.38,0:28:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但是没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻地帮你放松
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子的最敏感的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.62,0:28:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 再试一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.73,0:28:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都湿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.13,0:28:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别看了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 这里都有痕迹了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.57,0:29:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.52,0:29:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸都被你弄湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.28,0:29:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,由美你是变态啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔稍微碰了一下胸部和耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.13,0:29:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来到的家很开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.72,0:29:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.04,0:29:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔只是碰了一下这里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.44,0:29:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就已经湿成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.61,0:29:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,已经湿成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一来就坐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.58,0:29:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害啊由美
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.65,0:30:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只是隔着裤子摸而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.99,0:30:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的内裤到回家前应该会干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.83,0:30:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你没带备用的内裤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.55,0:30:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,应该会干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.66,0:30:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没带备用的内裤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.68,0:31:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,完全湿透了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要脱掉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 把这里抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.26,0:31:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.24,0:31:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这么湿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.86,0:31:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.64,0:31:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是一个人就想这些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.34,0:31:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.02,0:31:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.73,0:31:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.78,0:31:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,让我好好看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.19,0:32:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,松开手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.53,0:32:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.93,0:32:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,松开手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.12,0:32:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,松手了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.98,0:32:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,声都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.78,0:32:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,声出来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.54,0:32:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你的这里也很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.47,0:32:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.55,0:32:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.14,0:33:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.22,0:33:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.92,0:33:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.22,0:33:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.25,0:33:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个变态呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,流了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.24,0:34:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,指头
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要伸进去了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.26,0:34:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.99,0:34:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.55,0:34:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.50,0:34:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.33,0:34:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.93,0:34:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.48,0:34:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家在这里都觉得很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.85,0:34:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 两根手指能进去吗\N- 紧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很紧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.46,0:34:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.35,0:35:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我要继续推进了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.04,0:35:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看 进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.08,0:35:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在两根手指在里面哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.36,0:35:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这样动的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.28,0:35:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.12,0:35:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.54,0:35:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我做得不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.92,0:35:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.86,0:35:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子也是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.49,0:35:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 没事的 可以出声哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.16,0:35:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你感到更多的愉悦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.69,0:35:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.34,0:36:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也要好好享受哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.15,0:36:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.34,0:36:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.92,0:36:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,咧嘴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.65,0:36:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,腹部的粗糙地方很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.56,0:36:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 弄脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.83,0:36:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.72,0:37:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那我多喂你一些
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.97,0:37:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.64,0:37:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,交给医生就好了 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.24,0:37:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要好好享受哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.66,0:38:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 由美
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.86,0:38:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我做得好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.34,0:38:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.72,0:38:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那下次由美
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.28,0:38:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能让叔叔舒服吗\N- 能让我舒服吗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.29,0:38:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.24,0:38:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.50,0:39:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看 醒过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.05,0:39:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,男人会给你带来舒服的感觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.51,0:39:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.32,0:39:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 要亲吻小弟弟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.30,0:39:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是这样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,成年人在得到舒服之后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也要让别人舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.81,0:39:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要互相回报才行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.30,0:39:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看 先摸一摸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.94,0:39:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.62,0:40:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.96,0:40:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,认真看
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.15,0:40:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把手伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.26,0:40:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,摸一摸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.77,0:40:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.28,0:40:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,男人最喜欢这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.81,0:40:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才叔叔亲吻了由美吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.84,0:40:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,同样 由美也要亲吻叔叔的小弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.38,0:41:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.36,0:41:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看 把舌头伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.13,0:41:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗡嗡地舔哦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.92,0:41:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.88,0:41:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,难受吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.03,0:41:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那就用舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.81,0:41:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,用由美的舌头先舔一舔尖端吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.86,0:42:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.30,0:42:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,即使这样也会很舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.16,0:42:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.37,0:42:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 只要舔舔就会很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,再往这边根部一点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.62,0:42:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小弟弟的 对 侧面也行
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.34,0:42:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.28,0:42:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.88,0:42:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,由美真是个聪明的孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.50,0:42:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,记忆力很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.47,0:42:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.02,0:42:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地这样舔下去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.66,0:42:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,到尖端
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.95,0:43:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,舔一舔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.56,0:43:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.94,0:43:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.01,0:43:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.67,0:43:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,尖端是最舒服的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.48,0:43:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.37,0:43:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 叔叔要睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.74,0:43:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,侧躺过来继续舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.62,0:43:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.46,0:43:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.01,0:45:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.58,0:45:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.37,0:45:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,紧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.37,0:45:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 很快就会习惯的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.82,0:45:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.52,0:46:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,流口水也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.69,0:46:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,把声音放低点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.11,0:46:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小优真的好舒服啊 超级棒
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.50,0:46:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.74,0:46:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 就这样继续
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.29,0:46:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.54,0:46:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.03,0:46:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那么小优
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.72,0:46:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在可以开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.70,0:47:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.22,0:47:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就这里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.52,0:47:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你躺下看看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.63,0:47:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看 就在这里躺下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.97,0:47:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把脸转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.51,0:47:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,来到真央家很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.28,0:47:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小优这里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.59,0:47:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,已经湿透了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.27,0:47:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样摩擦一下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.83,0:47:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,会更湿的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.56,0:47:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这次也是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.88,0:47:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要涂要涂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.92,0:47:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当然要涂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.29,0:47:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.78,0:48:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我会好好涂的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.12,0:48:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,已经涂好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.60,0:48:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.77,0:48:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.56,0:48:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看 进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.52,0:49:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.04,0:49:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.44,0:49:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看 已经进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.64,0:49:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,小优 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.19,0:49:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.34,0:49:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要全部进去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.58,0:49:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,全部进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.05,0:50:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,都进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.84,0:50:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.98,0:50:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.53,0:50:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥这里好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.17,0:50:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,紧得很呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.37,0:50:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小优全身都是静观体
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.34,0:51:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,身上都起鸡皮疙瘩了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.98,0:51:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.16,0:51:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来回抽动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.10,0:51:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.36,0:51:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.88,0:52:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.34,0:52:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那里紧紧地收缩了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.25,0:52:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔的家伙被紧紧地包裹住了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.81,0:52:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才就去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.06,0:52:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.66,0:52:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.84,0:52:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 再来一次抓住它
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.38,0:52:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,起身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.80,0:52:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给你亲一个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.84,0:52:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在这边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.72,0:53:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚就去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.30,0:53:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.06,0:53:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.96,0:53:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子 感觉很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.36,0:53:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,下次 由里你就坐在上面动一动试试
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.82,0:53:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,能动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.81,0:53:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 能做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样 上下动
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.26,0:53:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.86,0:53:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.11,0:53:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.83,0:54:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.90,0:54:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.36,0:54:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥刚才有点儿忙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.72,0:54:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你坐上去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.38,0:54:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.06,0:55:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.74,0:55:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,又去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.57,0:55:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那里又紧紧的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.04,0:55:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.46,0:55:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,又去了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.02,0:55:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小优说的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.98,0:55:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你好好看看这里进去的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.70,0:55:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这次换个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.84,0:55:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.44,0:55:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,背对着
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.65,0:56:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对 后面
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.18,0:56:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把屁股朝向这边
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.50,0:56:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.78,0:56:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这里又紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.58,0:56:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把屁股朝向这边
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.14,0:56:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.84,0:56:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,又紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.78,0:56:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 看看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.94,0:56:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,又紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.48,0:56:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看 进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.96,0:56:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.18,0:56:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你看的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.30,0:56:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.16,0:57:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.40,0:57:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.68,0:57:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.50,0:57:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.06,0:57:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 优
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.16,0:57:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看 哥哥的手机在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.82,0:57:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.58,0:57:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.84,0:57:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这边有个手柄
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.18,0:57:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 对
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.58,0:57:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吗这里也有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.90,0:57:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 有点出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.78,0:58:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.92,0:58:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不出来的话 这边也行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.30,0:58:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎力气也小了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.92,0:59:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.44,0:59:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.42,0:59:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你这表情真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.56,0:59:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.56,1:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 太爽了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.50,1:00:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 要睡着了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.32,1:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意舔叔叔的舌头吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.32,1:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的在里面颤抖呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.34,1:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有点热
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.92,1:01:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.81,1:01:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 都出来了这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.38,1:01:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,出了这么多好久没见了 叔叔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.02,1:01:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是生死啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.26,1:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.07,1:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,男性的生死
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.42,1:01:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看过吗\N- 怎么会这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.44,1:01:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 都出来了这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.22,1:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个 精液
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.58,1:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是真正的精液
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.82,1:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,滑滑的 有点味道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.65,1:02:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.44,1:02:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,滑滑的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.64,1:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以舔哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.18,1:02:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.74,1:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.32,1:04:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种地方叫你过来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.93,1:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再见到柚子真高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.34,1:04:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,以为再也见不到了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.38,1:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当时有男朋友吗\N- 呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.65,1:04:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当时还没有
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.95,1:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是在那之后吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.22,1:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,君
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.18,1:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.28,1:04:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,向我表白了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.01,1:04:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.80,1:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.32,1:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就不再联系了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.93,1:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔教的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.60,1:04:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有用吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.25,1:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.24,1:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,教过你很多吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.72,1:05:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,关于你的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.79,1:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.56,1:05:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想聊聊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.52,1:05:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,打算的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.74,1:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没那个意思
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.14,1:05:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是最后
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.47,1:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还是和叔叔做了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.84,1:05:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.62,1:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不如试试做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.03,1:05:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.87,1:05:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.52,1:05:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.84,1:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,和直屋君交往了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.99,1:05:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,交往了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.97,1:05:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再说
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.46,1:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在非常后悔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.02,1:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,和直屋君
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.73,1:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,初次交往的时候就应该更加珍惜
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.75,1:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,过度看重性爱不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.51,1:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.33,1:05:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,和直屋君
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.26,1:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始交往的时候要是更珍惜就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.26,1:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太把性爱当回事
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.47,1:06:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.38,1:06:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有感情的性爱也不会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.93,1:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.76,1:06:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是成年人的话
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.43,1:06:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得可以更轻松地看待这个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.04,1:06:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢 其实我并不想再做这样的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.87,1:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.53,1:06:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这张照片 他看到会怎么想呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.91,1:06:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到会怎么想呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.86,1:06:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 我会帮你们保密的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.34,1:06:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的事情 咱们就当是秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.01,1:06:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体还是那么漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.99,1:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,舅舅的舌头 你要不要舔一下
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.35,1:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.24,1:07:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这是我们的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.52,1:08:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.05,1:08:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,再露出来一点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.70,1:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体还是那么漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.35,1:09:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.69,1:09:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在动呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.66,1:09:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,转过身来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.14,1:09:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.94,1:09:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.90,1:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.87,1:09:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给我舔一下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.42,1:09:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.17,1:10:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.26,1:10:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.88,1:10:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.33,1:10:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真厉害记得很清楚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.22,1:10:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我之前说过会让你舒服的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.91,1:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好孩子 由美
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.27,1:11:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我教你的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.32,1:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都记住了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.85,1:11:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.19,1:11:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,EVA影像
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.90,1:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.92,1:12:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有点冷 由美
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.30,1:12:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个星期都还冷呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.11,1:12:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.28,1:12:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么说嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.25,1:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你一直看到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.22,1:12:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要跑十公里为什么\N- 博士说 比赛也快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.32,1:12:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真冷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.16,1:12:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.87,1:12:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.45,1:12:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,外公
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.28,1:12:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你真棒 由美
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.05,1:12:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.45,1:13:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好孩子 做得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.96,1:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.50,1:13:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.38,1:13:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.09,1:13:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.62,1:13:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,由美
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.32,1:13:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,今天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.26,1:13:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要教你新东西
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.12,1:13:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.52,1:13:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把嘴巴张开
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.20,1:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊~啊~
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.83,1:13:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大点
