Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.49,1:36:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看 全进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.59,1:37:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看 躺下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.55,1:37:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,由美的下面湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.76,1:37:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.18,1:37:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你清理的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.48,1:37:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮由美清理的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.04,1:37:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.90,1:37:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 还是生的好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.60,1:37:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说过喜欢生的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.93,1:37:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢生的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.72,1:38:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,生的...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.43,1:38:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我会做的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.86,1:38:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.40,1:38:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.45,1:38:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.79,1:38:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看 声音都出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.53,1:38:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.42,1:38:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,由美
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.25,1:38:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.01,1:38:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.07,1:38:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,由美的下面在发出声音
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.64,1:38:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.63,1:39:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还想更紧点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.22,1:40:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你还是忘不了那天的事
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.48,1:40:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.14,1:40:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,由美
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.80,1:40:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,电话响了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.06,1:40:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是男朋友打来的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.76,1:40:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,要睡觉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.34,1:40:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.05,1:40:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办\N- 挂断了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.37,1:41:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.66,1:41:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.00,1:41:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.24,1:41:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,之后 不行的 是坏事
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.66,1:41:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,君 我 不是和...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.09,1:41:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和其他人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.74,1:42:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.00,1:42:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.46,1:42:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.57,1:42:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,本来你也应该在看书吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.78,1:42:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.64,1:43:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小优有时候会分心
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.33,1:43:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.24,1:43:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.92,1:43:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你来
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.80,1:44:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今天来到我这里
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.60,1:44:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.10,1:44:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.36,1:44:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是普通的公寓而已
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.82,1:44:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢 而且这边...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.80,1:44:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,君的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.76,1:44:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.44,1:44:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我去一下
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.48,1:44:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.17,1:44:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.06,1:44:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.11,1:44:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,您稍等
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.54,1:44:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真没想到
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.12,1:44:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,同一个节目里...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.92,1:44:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小优的男朋友也在...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.22,1:44:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哪想到会这样...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.85,1:44:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.36,1:44:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.16,1:44:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.93,1:44:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且没想到是邻居...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.74,1:45:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.78,1:45:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小优
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.24,1:45:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的男朋友可能会听到哦
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.47,1:45:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这会让人兴奋的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.70,1:45:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这里湿了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.58,1:46:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.33,1:46:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,声音大了 男朋友会听得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.89,1:46:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没回来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.74,1:46:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要变成冰箱了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.70,1:46:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 我会加热吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.90,1:46:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样\N- 我能做到这些
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.78,1:46:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.92,1:46:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我会好好做的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.61,1:46:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.62,1:46:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.46,1:46:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我在找钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.80,1:46:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,能安静点进来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.72,1:46:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不要说出来
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.16,1:46:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小优
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.40,1:46:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没带钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.63,1:46:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.36,1:46:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.31,1:46:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我要出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.92,1:47:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能在打电话
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.96,1:47:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我这样碰你
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.88,1:47:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你会听到的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.36,1:47:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.56,1:47:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.94,1:47:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天做了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.80,1:48:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.22,1:48:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太湿了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.42,1:48:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,会听到声音的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.22,1:48:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来的话
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.54,1:48:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就会说出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.84,1:48:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小悠 你太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.32,1:48:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真的走了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.28,1:48:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.50,1:48:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的走了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.40,1:48:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们进去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.80,1:48:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,过来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.30,1:49:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 悠
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.60,1:49:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿这个很合适
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.02,1:49:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 不是在家里 是在酒店吗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.73,1:49:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,酒店
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.03,1:49:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.43,1:49:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是不喜欢在男朋友旁边的那个房间吗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.27,1:49:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢出轨
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.69,1:49:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小结衣 穿着这么性感的衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.13,1:49:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也能在我面前站得住呢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.08,1:49:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.81,1:49:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.23,1:50:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能在两分钟内让我满意的话
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.33,1:50:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我就结束
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.61,1:50:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我会结束的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.02,1:50:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.54,1:50:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,两分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.10,1:50:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是两分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.69,1:50:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.13,1:50:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在只能拿出计时器了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.94,1:50:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.66,1:50:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在两分钟内让我满意的话
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.56,1:50:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很简单吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.63,1:50:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.50,1:50:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天就到这里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.07,1:50:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.14,1:50:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.38,1:50:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.59,1:50:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.14,1:50:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看 小悠
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.40,1:50:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.24,1:50:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.50,1:50:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,让男人
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.36,1:50:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,活着
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.43,1:50:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.04,1:50:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以去男朋友那里了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.20,1:51:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,小悠
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.66,1:51:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你自由了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.81,1:51:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看 加油哦
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.58,1:51:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,时间快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.37,1:51:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再刺激一点
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.06,1:51:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不碰你的乳头
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.27,1:51:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,摸一下乳头就会兴奋起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.70,1:51:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看 已经硬起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.17,1:51:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,来舔一舔我的乳头吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.32,1:51:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可能会更舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.88,1:52:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要舔吗\N- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.34,1:52:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 舔一舔
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.70,1:52:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你摸得到我变硬了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.80,1:52:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哦
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.69,1:52:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.79,1:52:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才更硬了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.85,1:52:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 因为很舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.62,1:52:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不过呢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.28,1:52:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小悠 用手摸一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.62,1:53:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,用嘴巴来
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.46,1:53:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.77,1:53:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,舔一舔我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.92,1:53:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,结衣
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.00,1:53:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想要去你男朋友那里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.28,1:53:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.90,1:53:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我想去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.16,1:53:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.08,1:53:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.21,1:53:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.29,1:54:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,用手摸一摸
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.48,1:54:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来结束一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.65,1:54:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再来得更激烈一点
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.41,1:54:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.86,1:54:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.74,1:54:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.64,1:54:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再激烈一点
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.92,1:54:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.80,1:55:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.08,1:55:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害啊 小悠
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.07,1:55:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.38,1:55:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不过小悠
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.20,1:55:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,时间已经超了这么多 叔叔很遗憾地说
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.32,1:55:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过呢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.41,1:55:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过两分钟内要结束的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.79,1:55:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果做不到的话
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.94,1:55:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,时间已经超了这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.33,1:55:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是约定好的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.20,1:55:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.95,1:55:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来 这样趴下来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.10,1:55:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.15,1:56:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小悠的身体真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.59,1:56:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.54,1:56:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这是约定好的 没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.82,1:56:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把屁股再翘高一点
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.58,1:56:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱的小屁屁
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.31,1:56:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.88,1:56:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.35,1:56:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,又湿了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.28,1:56:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,明明
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.76,1:56:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你很兴奋呢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.68,1:56:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我来舔一舔吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.60,1:57:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.36,1:57:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.23,1:57:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越湿了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.06,1:57:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,男朋友在旁边听着吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.66,1:57:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你用这个哦
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.15,1:57:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.80,1:57:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在发抖吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.53,1:57:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,咬咬🐶
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.66,1:57:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.45,1:57:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,声都出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.06,1:58:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,悲伤得声音都传出去了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.53,1:58:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.48,1:58:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,路易的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.02,1:58:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里 柚子
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.39,1:58:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,柚子最敏感的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.16,1:58:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.78,1:58:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看 就是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.48,1:58:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在忍耐吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.54,1:58:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把脸给我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.40,1:58:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.58,1:58:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.34,1:58:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你在拼命忍耐呢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.34,1:58:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,出声吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.42,1:59:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.56,1:59:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再加大点力度哦
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.20,1:59:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 啊 不行了 不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.18,1:59:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.77,1:59:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.20,1:59:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.75,1:59:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来也没关系哦 看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.78,1:59:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看 看 看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.20,1:59:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.10,1:59:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看 来了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.48,1:59:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还没停呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.30,1:59:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,多来几次
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.48,1:59:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.40,1:59:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.28,1:59:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不行吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.24,1:59:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,柚子
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.34,1:59:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边有男朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.45,2:00:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看 看
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.52,2:00:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.92,2:00:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,喔~
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.80,2:00:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么冷淡
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.54,2:00:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以哦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.66,2:00:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在发抖呢 看看
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.90,2:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了 不行了 不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.22,2:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西能听到了哦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.08,2:00:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,完全听到了 看看
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.44,2:00:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 还能来吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.20,2:01:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不行呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.45,2:01:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在卡沙君旁边呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.90,2:01:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,都来了这么多回了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.81,2:01:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还发出这么大的声音
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.34,2:01:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,坏孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.82,2:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是个坏孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.96,2:01:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是这么想要吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.82,2:01:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我就给你来这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.46,2:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,听得见哦
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.60,2:02:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.72,2:02:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.23,2:03:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,邻居家的大叔也挺激动的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.34,2:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想和柚伊做
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.88,2:03:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你的屁股都快朝这边了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.42,2:03:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.62,2:04:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.26,2:04:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.22,2:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.44,2:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.86,2:04:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.13,2:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,柚伊 自己动一动试试
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.13,2:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就这样摩擦
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.48,2:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.40,2:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,呼呼呼
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.26,2:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太激动了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.76,2:05:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.78,2:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,朝阿姨那边看看
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.96,2:05:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.36,2:05:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再多摩擦一下试试 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.82,2:05:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好 由美
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.70,2:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.96,2:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.52,2:06:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我是前辈哦
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.48,2:06:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说过很多次了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.13,2:07:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 还没结束呢我说过不会停的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.86,2:07:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一点 不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.36,2:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,由美
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.76,2:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,自己再动一动
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.94,2:07:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我要让你更舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.50,2:07:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.04,2:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来了来了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.64,2:07:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 来了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.94,2:07:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.64,2:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.35,2:07:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你特别兴奋
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.38,2:07:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害呢 呀
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.19,2:07:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为旁边有你的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.20,2:07:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个坏孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.66,2:08:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.68,2:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,和我偷情呢
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.54,2:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你躺下试试
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.52,2:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.30,2:08:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太放纵自己哦 由美
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.54,2:09:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.10,2:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.56,2:09:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得真舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.38,2:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:17.00,Watermark,,0,0,0,,成人世界里,一个就够了\N ONE一个
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:37.00,Watermark,,0,0,0,,成人世界里,一个就够了\N ONE一个
